TI  - Designing a BIM-enhanced digital twin architecture for construction pollution management in building renovation projects
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF CONSTRUCTION MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Building information modelling (BIM)
KW  - digital platform
