TI  - Investigating the Correlation and Synergy of Artificial Intelligence Techniques, Construction Technologies, and Their Key Benefits
T2  - JOURNAL OF ARCHITECTURAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - PROJECT
KW  - RELIABILITY
KW  - CHALLENGES
KW  - VALIDITY
