TI  - Research on Management Efficiency and Public Participation in Smart City Construction Based on BIM-CIM Technology
T2  - JOURNAL OF URBAN PLANNING AND DEVELOPMENT
LA  - English
KW  - BIM-CIM integration
KW  - Digital platform
KW  - Participatory smart city governance
KW  - Digital twin
