TI  - Exploring the Adoption of Construction Technologies in Infrastructure Projects: Bridging Perceptions of Experts with Real Project Data
T2  - JOURNAL OF INFRASTRUCTURE SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - SOCIAL NETWORK ANALYSIS
KW  - BIM
KW  - CHALLENGES
KW  - MANAGEMENT
KW  - BENEFITS
KW  - INDUSTRY
