TI  - Digital twin safety analysis of large-span spatial structure based on airborne LiDAR
T2  - JOURNAL OF BUILDING ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Airborne LiDAR
KW  - Spatial structure
KW  - Geometric digital twin
KW  - Initial geometric defects
