TI  - Efficient edge-cloud digital twin for real-time SHM with server-deployed FEA and fast particle swarm optimization
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - Structural safety
KW  - Real-time health monitoring
