TI  - Automated generation and semantic segmentation of roof orthophoto for digital twin-based monitoring of slated roofs
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Roof orthophoto
KW  - Slate
KW  - Photogrammetry
