TI  - Towards a Digital Twin Approach for Structural Stiffness Assessment: A Case Study on the Cho'ponota L1 Bridge
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - digital twin
KW  - dynamic amplification factor
KW  - dynamic characteristics
KW  - operational modal analysis
