TI  - Digital twin-based multiscale fatigue crack life prediction of rib-to-deck weld joints
T2  - JOURNAL OF CONSTRUCTIONAL STEEL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - OSD
KW  - RTD weld joints
KW  - Fatigue crack propagation
