TI  - Digital twin-based framework for multi-objective optimization of shield tunneling parameters
T2  - TUNNELLING AND UNDERGROUND SPACE TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Shield tunneling
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - Parameter optimization
KW  - Multi-objective optimization
