TI  - A Digital Twin With Material Characterisation and LLM as High-Level Orchestrator via Few-Shot In-Context Learning for Closed-Loop Control in Robotic Adaptive 3DCP
T2  - STRUCTURAL CONTROL & HEALTH MONITORING
LA  - English
KW  - 3DPC performance predictive model
KW  - adaptive 3D concrete printing
KW  - closed-loop control
KW  - cyberphysical production systems
