TI  - Challenges in the application of digital transformation to inspection and maintenance of bridges
T2  - STRUCTURE AND INFRASTRUCTURE ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - Digital transformation
KW  - bridge maintenance
KW  - bridge inspection
KW  - digital twin
KW  - structural health monitoring
