TI  - A Digital Twin of Life-Cycle Bearing Based on a Defect-Guided Conditional Diffusion Model for Predicting Remaining Life under Limited Degradation Data
T2  - ASCE-ASME JOURNAL OF RISK AND UNCERTAINTY IN ENGINEERING SYSTEMS PART A-CIVIL ENGINEERING
