TI  - Constructing a Reliable Health Indicator for Bearings Using Convolutional Autoencoder and Continuous Wavelet Transform
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - health indicator
KW  - performance degradation assessment
KW  - deep learning
KW  - vibration monitoring
KW  - bearing
KW  - remaining useful life
