TI  - A hybrid approach for optimizing deep excavation safety measures based on Bayesian network and design structure matrix
T2  - ADVANCED ENGINEERING INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - Deep excavation
KW  - Dynamic safety risk management
KW  - Multi-objective optimization
KW  - Digital twin model
KW  - MANAGEMENT
