TI  - Development of Digital/Visual Twin for Real-Time Leak Detection in Gas Pipelines Under Multiphase Flow Conditions
T2  - GREENHOUSE GASES-SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - CO2 pipelines
