TI  - Toward intelligent tunnel construction: The universal discontinuity index for rapid probabilistic prediction of progressive batch rock-block failure-A theoretical, numerical, and experimental validation framework
T2  - TUNNELLING AND UNDERGROUND SPACE TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Universal discontinuity index (UDi)
KW  - Probabilistic rock-block instability
