TI  - Failure Conditions Assessment of Complex Water Systems Using Fuzzy Logic
T2  - WATER RESOURCES MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Water resources resilience
KW  - Digital twins
KW  - Failure modes
KW  - System dynamics model
KW  - CONTINUOUS BAYESIAN NETWORK
KW  - DAMS RISK-ASSESSMENT
KW  - MODES
